WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:21.050 --> 00:01:27.050
<b>In ﻿the Cosmos With You</b>

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:31.760
﻿Everyone...

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:33.350
﻿Here's your meal.

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:36.280
﻿You can leave it there.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:37.450
﻿We'll be finished in just a bit.

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:38.690
﻿Alright.

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:43.950
﻿What's wrong?

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:45.360
It's nothing...

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:50.750
No way...

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:53.210
It's still far too early.

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:57.670
﻿Joliver, the Ideon gauge!

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:12.560
﻿What happened?

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:13.890
﻿I don't know. Suddenly the power...

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:15.110
﻿The Ideon Gauge?!

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:27.780
Did we accelerate into subspace?

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.750
﻿Joliver, what's happening?

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:32.530
﻿Why are we accelerating at such an incredible rate?

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:34.540
﻿How should I know?!

00:02:34.540 --> 00:02:36.410
Check the flow of the Ide!

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:41.510
﻿The Ide is flowing towards the engine room!

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:43.960
Is the Ide trying to do something?

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:45.430
That can't be!

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:47.930
﻿This is our ship! The Ide can't control us!

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:48.930
But...

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:52.130
The Ide has more power than us!

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:10.410
We stopped?

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:11.870
﻿Why is that?

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.130
﻿Karala, are you injured?

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.590
﻿Thank you, I'm alright.

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:40.360
﻿Karala!

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:54.210
﻿They vanished!

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.460
﻿Karala and Joliver, they vanished!

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:01.760
﻿Joliver!

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:03.220
﻿Karala!

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:05.220
﻿They vanished?!

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:07.460
Impossible! Did you search for them?

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:10.150
There's nowhere to search!

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:12.880
﻿They were right in front of me,
 then vanished in a flash of light!

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:14.630
There's no way that could have happened!

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:16.230
﻿Go look one more time!

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:17.690
﻿But...

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.320
Are you sure this isn't an enemy attack?

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:24.490
﻿Could the Buff Clan have developed
﻿some kind of Micro DS Drive?

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:26.260
We'd be finished.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:29.240
Imagine they sent something like
 a nuclear bomb inside the ship.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.540
Even if the Solo Ship could last,
 we wouldn't survive.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.920
Give it up already!

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:39.460
﻿No matter what we do, we're just
﻿dancing in the palms of the Ide.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.760
﻿That's all we are doing!

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:03.150
﻿What?

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:04.110
﻿What's happening?!

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:05.950
Space-time distortions near the Bairal Jin!

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:08.070
Unknown space-time distortions spotted!

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.780
﻿Is time and space warping?!

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:22.250
Where are we?

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.160
What?!

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.180
﻿Who are you people?!

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:29.470
﻿What are you doing here?

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:30.010
Raise your hands!

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:31.180
﻿Joliver, run!
﻿Raise your hands!

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:32.140
﻿Hold it!

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:35.890
Intruders spotted!

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:38.190
They're running towards sector 205!

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:39.060
﻿Let's go!

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:41.440
﻿Intruders at sector 205!

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.480
﻿Pursue them at once!

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.610
﻿Intruders at sector 205!

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:45.860
﻿Pursue them at once!

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:51.990
This way!

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:53.490
﻿Got them!

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:55.070
Over here!

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:58.210
How on earth did we end up here?

00:05:58.210 --> 00:05:59.370
﻿I don't know...

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:02.530
But this is clearly a Buff Clan ship.

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:03.950
Is this the Ide's plan?

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:05.150
Seems so.

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:11.000
﻿Come on, Karala!

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:17.420
All right, step no further!

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:20.480
Lady Karala!

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:28.070
﻿Karala?!

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.070
﻿My daughter, Karala?!

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.910
That can't possibly be right!

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:37.120
I'm sorry, but that's the truth.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.580
﻿Supreme Commander Doba, take a look.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.750
This is clearly Lady Karala.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:44.030
She's grown into a woman...

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:48.130
Karala...

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.430
Any sign of the enemy?

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:53.050
Nothing at all!

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:02.260
﻿This ship is huge...

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:03.270
﻿Yes...

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:06.570
This might be one of those
 giant battleships I heard of.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:08.570
My father might be on board.

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:11.280
And if I manage to meet my father...

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:13.400
﻿But ﻿now's not the best time...

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:16.450
Lady Karala, stop right there.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:19.580
﻿We cut the power.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:20.370
﻿Raise your hands!

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:32.430
﻿Father...

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:35.300
﻿Did you hear that?

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:36.010
﻿Yeah.

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:38.660
﻿That was Karala's voice, ﻿wasn’t it?!

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:39.810
﻿Yes...

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:40.810
﻿Bes, look!

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:43.100
﻿Karala...

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:44.100
﻿It's Joliver!

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.400
﻿Is this a mirage?

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:48.690
No, it's the Ide.

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:51.550
The power of Ide is sending us this image.

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:57.910
﻿How did you get in?

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:00.530
We were guided by the Ide.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:01.860
By the Ide?

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:05.370
The Ide...

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:07.630
For what reason?

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.420
﻿To use me as a messenger.

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:11.760
﻿You say you're the Ide's messenger?

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:12.590
﻿Yes.

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:15.930
Has the Ide expressed such a will?

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:16.760
﻿Yes.

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:22.870
﻿Depending on what you say,
﻿I might throw you out into space.

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:23.940
﻿Got it?

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:25.930
﻿And you call yourself a parent?!

00:08:25.930 --> 00:08:26.940
﻿She's your own daughter!

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:28.640
﻿Joliver, let me handle this.

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:33.110
Because of my daughter, thousands
﻿of our soldiers are now dead!

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.310
It's too late to...

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:37.270
You've done well learning
﻿the Buff Clan's language.

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:38.910
﻿Learning your language?!

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:41.070
﻿It's mine...

00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:43.780
﻿Is this the work of the Ide?!

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:51.250
Is there anything you can do?

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:53.780
There's an undefined part in the flow of the Ide.

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:57.220
﻿If we determine the end point of the
 waves, we might be able to find them...

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:57.840
I'm counting on you.

00:08:58.270 --> 00:08:59.800
﻿Karala...

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:01.210
﻿Bes?

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:03.270
﻿The Ide?!

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:04.770
﻿Father...

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:07.790
﻿No, Supreme Commander Doba.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:13.150
﻿You should already understand that
 fighting ﻿enlarges the Ide's power.

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:17.770
﻿The meteors falling on our
planet are increasing, aren't they?

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:22.540
﻿Those meteors are originating ﻿from your spaceship!

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:25.820
Thus we have no choice but to
 eliminate Solo Ship and the Giant!

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.750
﻿The Ide has started to harness
﻿the power to defend itself!

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:32.840
﻿It's become impossible for us to control.

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:34.550
﻿That's why we can't leave it alone!

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:37.430
If aliens take hold of its power...

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:40.760
﻿Who will guarantee that our green
﻿Earth won't be attacked?

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:42.630
﻿I'll bet my life on it!

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:44.100
﻿Don't be absurd!

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:47.520
﻿A traitor's life is worth nothing.

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:49.020
﻿What guarantee is that?

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:53.820
﻿You call them Logo Dau Aliens, but they're
no different from the Buff Clan.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.540
﻿We can certainly come to terms.

00:09:56.110 --> 00:10:00.810
﻿The proof is that there is a new
﻿life growing inside my abdomen!

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:01.950
﻿What?!

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:04.520
﻿There's a child inside of her body?

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:06.620
﻿Karala...

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.040
﻿Damn you!

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:18.020
﻿D-Doba!

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.320
The results are out. They're surprisingly close!

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:24.150
﻿Okay! Let's rescue them!

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:36.190
This is the least amount of mercy I can give.

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:38.640
I'll kill you swiftly! ﻿Don't move!

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:41.350
Are you going to kill your own child?!

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:43.650
﻿For the honor of the Ajiba house!

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:49.580
To protect the new life inside of me...

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:52.040
﻿I'm ready to bear the disgrace of killing my father!

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:54.170
﻿Karala!

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:58.130
﻿From this range...

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:02.200
This laser transmitter will surely
﻿shoot through your heart.

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:05.920
﻿You can attack me,

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:07.500
﻿but these soldiers will shoot you to death!

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:10.640
As you wish, father.

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:14.930
In return, ﻿the Ide's power which brought us here...

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:20.490
﻿will send thousands of soldiers
﻿if anything happens to us.

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:23.020
﻿This ship is already under watch!

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:26.620
﻿You said the Ide's power can't be controlled!

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:28.750
﻿That's right.

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:31.370
﻿We don't have the control ﻿to weaken it's power.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:34.170
﻿But we can strengthen it...

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:36.130
﻿Supreme Commander Doba...

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:38.960
﻿I don't think Lady Karala is bluffing.

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:41.170
Still, our forces can't pull back!

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:43.540
﻿Those two are here for real!

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:47.250
I still can't allow this!

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:51.480
Karala!

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:55.400
﻿Have the entire ship on full alert!

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:57.690
﻿These aliens could show up anywhere!

00:11:57.690 --> 00:12:00.110
﻿And as soon as you find Karala...

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:00.610
Kill her!

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:25.920
﻿Are you alright?

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:30.310
﻿Yeah, ﻿but I never expected my work
 electrometer to be useful here.

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:39.270
Is this the hangar for the Heavy Mobile Mecha?

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:40.650
﻿We can escape with these!

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:42.110
Yes!

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:53.330
﻿What was that?!

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.160
Did you find them?

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:03.010
There are slight gravitational
 distortions near the Bairal Jin...

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:04.010
﻿Find their origin!

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:05.010
Yes, sir!

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:07.590
Have you still not found Karala?!

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:11.140
﻿Supreme Commander, is the
 Bairal Jin going to be alright?

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:13.480
We'll see...

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:14.660
﻿Supreme Commander...

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:19.190
﻿It's here, the alien ship!

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.150
﻿In front of us?!

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:24.440
Cursed Logo Dau aliens!

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:29.700
There it is, right in front of us!

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:30.560
﻿Brake!

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:31.870
﻿No, keep going!

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.030
We'll ram into it!

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:35.330
﻿Those insolent Logo Dau aliens!

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:36.900
﻿Are they doing a suicide attack?!

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:48.300
This'll make it harder for other ships to attack us!

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:49.620
﻿Prepare to take on their ship!

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.620
The Solo Ship is here, Joliver!

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:17.590
Thanks...

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:20.450
They're here...

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:22.540
﻿The Solo Ship is here?

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:26.010
﻿This isn't a dream.

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:26.920
Let's get going!﻿

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:27.790
Sure.

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:30.930
Found them!

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:37.850
﻿Let's jump.

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:55.790
To the right!

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:56.450
﻿Roger!

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:03.570
﻿A squad of Adigos is approaching!

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:07.460
﻿The Ideon Gun...

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:10.500
﻿Solo Ship, Bes! Can't you launch the Ideon Gun?

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:16.180
﻿Bes! What is it?

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:18.020
In that monitor...

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:19.310
What's going on?

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:21.960
Some kind of internal strife?

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:23.600
Enlarging!

00:15:25.010 --> 00:15:27.850
Strange... Buff Clan soldiers chasing each other?

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:36.740
﻿Karala...

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:38.570
﻿It's Karala!

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:40.310
﻿Bes, where are you going?

00:15:40.360 --> 00:15:41.210
﻿To the gun turret!

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:50.130
﻿Screw you!

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:57.930
﻿Cosmo!

00:15:57.930 --> 00:16:00.440
﻿What now? We're getting surrounded!

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:05.320
﻿Where are they?

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:06.690
﻿Over there!

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:09.930
﻿It's from the Solo Ship.

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:16.910
﻿Karala!

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.480
Let's escape using this.

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:20.790
﻿All right.

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:25.290
﻿Go to hell!

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:39.500
﻿You've gotten tougher!

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:41.930
Thanks.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:42.960
Let's go.

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:48.690
﻿Karala and Joliver have escaped!

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:50.440
﻿Pull out the Solo Ship!!

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:52.860
﻿Call back the Ideon and have it guard Karala!

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:53.440
﻿Roger!

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:58.660
So that's where Karala and Joliver are...

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.830
How can we cover them?

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:02.340
﻿Cosmo, catch them!

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:05.120
In the Ideon's hands, they'll be
 protected by the barrier!

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:07.860
﻿That seems to be the only way.

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:14.200
﻿Okay, I've got them!

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:22.470
﻿Karala!

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:26.350
﻿Karala!

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:27.520
﻿Joliver!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.030
﻿Why?!

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:36.570
﻿Why kill her?!

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:38.240
﻿Why do you have to fight?!

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:40.020
﻿Why can't you leave us alone?!

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:41.870
﻿Why did you kill Karala?

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:45.960
﻿Karala's ideals could have been
﻿the key to repressing the Ide!

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:47.750
﻿What is this?!

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.250
This is an alien's voice!

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:51.210
Are we hearing an alien language?

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:53.580
It's certainly a Logo Dau alien's voice...

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:56.170
﻿What happens if the Ide's power is unleashed?!

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:58.130
﻿No one knows!

00:17:58.130 --> 00:18:03.430
﻿Damn you! Will you take responsibility for this?

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:06.350
﻿Karala...

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:09.150
﻿Lou! Lou!

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:10.980
﻿Where is Lou? Hatari!

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:13.540
﻿He's with Lotta and the others
﻿in the center of the ship.

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:17.070
Because of that, the Ideon
﻿Gauge is staying normal.

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:22.980
﻿Okay, we're pulling out!

00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:24.320
Reverse the thrusters!

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:25.450
﻿Roger!

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:26.790
﻿Karala...

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:31.530
﻿Karala, are you really dead?

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:44.890
﻿Those aliens!

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:47.680
Why do they fight no matter what happens?

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:51.640
﻿They wouldn't have built that battleship
﻿if they didn't intend to use it!

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:53.320
﻿For the sake of the people of the Buff Clan...

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:57.010
﻿I'll stake everything on this grand
 fleet given to me by the Emperor...

00:18:57.010 --> 00:18:58.740
and eliminate every last one of them!

00:18:58.860 --> 00:18:59.530
﻿Cosmo!

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:01.480
﻿Let's return to the Solo Ship!

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:02.490
﻿Roger!

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:03.950
﻿We're running low on missiles.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:06.980
﻿Inside that light...

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:08.750
﻿Karala?

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:18.690
﻿Let's get out of here, Cosmo.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:21.460
﻿Roger, Karala.

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:28.600
﻿We've rescued Karala and Joliver.

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:29.310
﻿What?

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:31.100
﻿We've rescued Karala and Joliver!

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:33.600
﻿Cosmo, what did you say?

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:35.730
﻿We've rescued Karala and Joliver!

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.810
﻿Did you save them? Is Karala alive?

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:41.780
﻿Karala wasn't even injured! We saved them!

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:44.960
﻿Really? I see!

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:46.530
﻿Is Joliver safe too?

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:48.120
Yes, but he's been injured!

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:48.740
﻿Okay!

00:19:48.740 --> 00:19:51.240
﻿As soon as the Ideon lands, activate the DS Drive!

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:54.790
﻿Joliver, are you alright?

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:56.640
﻿Yeah, somehow...

00:19:57.670 --> 00:19:59.090
But I really blew it...

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:00.090
﻿What?

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:04.840
If I knew you were such a good person, 
I would've made a move on you before Bes.

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:08.290
﻿Thank you, Joliver.

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:26.910
﻿All units, pursue them!

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:29.450
﻿Chase them until the end of
﻿the universe if you have to...

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:31.950
﻿Just strike down the Logo Dau aliens' ship!

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:34.790
﻿At that very moment,

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:36.790
﻿the Ide was invoked.

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:43.090
﻿What is this?

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.080
What's happening?!

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:48.970
It was all planned by the Ide!

00:20:49.730 --> 00:20:51.430
﻿The Ide has been invoked!

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:55.330
﻿Everything...

00:20:55.460 --> 00:20:57.300
﻿Everything can perish for all I care!

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:14.500
Yes, Karala and Doba's meeting was
 the last chance granted by the Ide.

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:19.190
﻿And it was rejected by both sides.

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:24.880
﻿Because of that, the Ide released its infinite power.

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:29.470
The trigger for that power...

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:34.730
was the baby Karala was about to give birth to.

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:39.870
﻿And perhaps both the people
﻿of Earth and the Buff Clan...

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:43.730
were scattered into the plane of karma...

00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:47.950
The ends of the universe.
